 \\\"FT4\\\" returned \\\"No items found\\\"). Logged in as different buyer Sofia (non-owner) and reached the sold item's product page via SPA navigation: page showed \\\"This item is no longer available\\\" with no Add to Cart / Message Seller buttons present at all (owner-only \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" button also correctly absent since Sofia isn't the owner).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registered with name/email/password/location; toast \\\"Account created successfully!\\\" shown; header now shows Sell button and user name \\\"Timothee Tester\\\" indicating signed-in session.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Applied Category=Furniture + Condition=New filters (narrowed 10->3->2 items live), then applied Sort=Price Low to High: correctly showed only the 2 matching items (Upcycled Pallet Coffee Table $175, Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf $320) in ascending price order, confirming filters and sort combine correctly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typed \\\"SONY\\\" (uppercase) into search box; result correctly matched and displayed \\\"Sony Noise-Canceling Headphones\\\" (1 items available), confirming case-insensitive search.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Added \\\"Vintage Denim Jacket - Size M\\\" ($65) to cart from product page. Cart page correctly shows: item name, location (San Francisco, CA), price ($65), item count \\\"1 item\\\", and Total \\\"$65.00\\\" matching the item price exactly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking \\\"Send Purchase Request\\\" showed toast \\\"Purchase requests sent to sellers!\\\" and cart cleared to \\\"0 items\\\" / empty state immediately, cart badge removed from header.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category page link does not apply filter on Browse page\", \"actual\": \"On /categories, \\\"Furniture\\\" card correctly shows \\\"3 items\\\". Clicking it navigates to /?category=furniture, but the Browse page ignores the query param: heading shows \\\"10 items available\\\" (all items), the Furniture checkbox in the Filters sidebar is unchecked, and the full unfiltered list of 10 items (including Clothing, Electronics, Sports, etc.) is displayed instead of only the 3 Furniture items.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Seller cannot view/manage purchase requests\", \"actual\": \"After buyer (Sofia) sent a purchase request for Marcus's \\\"Vintage Denim Jacket - Size M\\\" (confirmed via toast \\\"Purchase requests sent to sellers!\\\" and cart clearing), logged in as seller Marcus Chen and checked My Listings, the item's product detail page, and header icons (cart/notification icons) — no purchase request, notification badge, or request-management UI was found anywhere. The listing still just shows generic \\\"Active\\\" status with View/Mark Sold/Delete actions, with no indication a purchase request was received. There appears to be no seller-side feature to view or respond to purchase requests at all.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Logging in with unregistered email 'nonexistent.user.qa@example.com' showed toast 'Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com', stayed on /login, and no session was created (header still showed Log in/Sign up).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Duplicate email not rejected for case-only variation\", \"actual\": \"Registering with 'Timothee.QA.Test26@Example.com' (case-variant of already-registered 'timothee.qa.test26@example.com') succeeded: toast said 'Account created successfully!' and a new account 'Duplicate Tester' was created and signed in, instead of being rejected as a duplicate.\", \"evidence\": \"Exact-case duplicate (emma@example.com) was correctly rejected with 'An account with this email already exists', showing case-sensitivity is the specific defect.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Password not verified on login\", \"actual\": \"Registered account 'qa.persist.check77@example.com' with password 'PersistPass123'. Logging in with an incorrect password 'WrongPass000' succeeded: toast 'Welcome back!' shown and user was signed in as 'QA Persist Test', instead of being rejected.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Logged in as Emma Green: viewing her own listing (prod-1, Mid-Century Modern Armchair) shows \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" button. Viewing Marcus Chen's listing (prod-2, Vintage Denim Jacket) as Emma shows only \\\"Add to Cart\\\"/\\\"Message Seller\\\" — no Manage/Mark Sold/Delete controls. Seller-management actions correctly restricted to the listing owner only.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Missing required fields not identified to seller (except photo)\", \"actual\": \"Submitting the Create Listing form with all fields empty produced no visible feedback at all (no toast, no field error text), just silently failed. Submitting with title and location empty (but photo/description/price/category/condition filled) also produced no toast or visible error message, only silent focus on the Title field. Only the missing-photo case shows a clear toast ('Please add at least one image'); other missing required fields are not identified to the seller.\", \"evidence\": \"Photo-only-missing submit showed toast 'Please add at least one image'. Title/Location-missing submit showed no toast/message at all.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting the listing form with price=-25 did not create a listing (stayed on /create-listing, no toast/navigation). Submitting the same form with price=125 succeeded and created the listing.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Logged out: clicking Add to Cart on product detail redirected to /login with toast \\\"Please log in to add items to your cart\\\"; Message Seller dialog showed disabled \\\"Log in to message\\\" button instead of allowing submission.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registering with existing email emma@example.com immediately showed toast 'An account with this email already exists' and the form remained populated and available on /register for correction.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typed \\\"SONY\\\" into search box without pressing Enter or clicking any submit button; results list updated live to show only \\\"Sony Noise-Canceling Headphones\\\" and count changed to \\\"1 items available\\\" immediately.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Checking Furniture checkbox live-updated count 10->3 items instantly (no submit). Adding New condition checkbox live-updated to 2 items instantly. Clicking \\\"Clear all filters\\\" instantly restored all 10 items with checkboxes unchecked, without any page reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking \\\"Add to Cart\\\" immediately triggered a \\\"Added to cart!\\\" toast and updated the header cart icon badge from no count to \\\"1\\\", with no page reload (button target ref remained valid, only a new toast/notification element appeared). Navigating to /cart via clicking the badge showed the item and correct $65.00 total instantly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Browse card for \\\"Vintage Denim Jacket - Size M\\\" showed: $65, San Francisco CA, Good. Product detail page (prod-2) shows matching: title \\\"Vintage Denim Jacket - Size M\\\", price $65, location \\\"San Francisco, CA (15 mi)\\\", condition \\\"Good\\\", category \\\"Clothing\\\" — all content consistent between Browse card and detail page.\"}]}"
      }
